%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a radial shading with a stitching function. Two exponential
% parts, joined at 0.6 with the second one reversed by its Encode, run
% from a point to a circle around it; the outer part is extended so the
% rest of the clip takes the end colour.
gsave
100 400 200 200 rectclip
<< /ShadingType 3 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB
   /Coords [200 500 0 200 500 90]
   /Function << /FunctionType 3 /Domain [0 1]
     /Functions [
       << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [1 1 1] /C1 [0.9 0.2 0.1] /N 1 >>
       << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [0.1 0.1 0.5] /C1 [0.9 0.2 0.1] /N 2 >> ]
     /Bounds [0.6] /Encode [0 1 1 0] >>
   /Extend [false true] >> shfill
grestore
showpage
